    Lifestyle habits:
12. Irregular bowel movements or diarrhoea;
13. Alcohol abuse or frequent alcohol drinking within 6 months prior to screening, that is, \> 14 units of alcohol consumption per week (1 unit = 360 mL beer or 45 mL of liquor with 40% alcohol or 150 mL wine), or positive result for breath alcohol test at screening;
